WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.747
&gt;&gt; Laura: LAST NIGHT, WE WERE

00:00:08.748 --> 00:00:10.882
THE ONLY ONE TO BRING YOU THE

00:00:10.883 --> 00:00:14.052
STORY OF HUNDREDS AND HUNDREDS

00:00:14.053 --> 00:00:16.521
OF CONGOLESE IMMIGRANTS BEING

00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:19.057
DROPPED OFF IN SAN ANTONIO AFTER

00:00:19.058 --> 00:00:19.958
CROSSING THE BORDER.

00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:21.526
FOR MANY OF THEM, THAT'S NOT THE

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:22.027
FINAL STOP.

00:00:22.028 --> 00:00:24.596
DR. COLLEEN BRIDGER REVEALED

00:00:24.597 --> 00:00:27.399
THIS TO A LOCAL CBS STATION.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.168
"THE PLAN WAS 350 OF THEM WOULD

00:00:30.169 --> 00:00:32.170
TRAVEL FROM SAN ANTONIO TO

00:00:32.171 --> 00:00:33.271
PORTLAND MAINE.

00:00:33.272 --> 00:00:35.974
WHEN WE REACHED OUT TO PORTLAND,

00:00:35.975 --> 00:00:38.910
MAINE, THEY SAID DON'T SEND US

00:00:38.911 --> 00:00:39.478
ANYMORE.

00:00:39.479 --> 00:00:40.178
WE'RE ALREADY STRETCHED WAY

00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:41.780
BEYOND OUR CAPACITY."

00:00:41.781 --> 00:00:44.649
WHY WOULD PORTLAND BE BEYOND

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:45.383
THEIR CAPACITY?

00:00:45.384 --> 00:00:48.720
I WANT TO GO BACK TO JANUARY OF

00:00:48.721 --> 00:00:51.523
THIS YEAR WHEN JANET MILLS GAVE

00:00:51.524 --> 00:00:52.257
HER INAUGURAL ADDRESS.

00:00:52.258 --> 00:00:55.026
&gt;&gt; WE WELCOME THE VOICES OF

00:00:55.027 --> 00:00:56.128
NEWCOMERS TO THE PUBLIC

00:00:56.129 --> 00:00:57.529
CONVERSATION, THE YOUNG, THE

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:59.664
IMMIGRANTS, PEOPLE OF DIFFERENT

00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:01.900
CULTURES, ALL ARE IMPORTANT

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:03.468
MEMBERS OF THE MAINE FAMILY.

00:01:03.469 --> 00:01:05.737
FROM NOW ON, YES, A SIGN WILL

00:01:05.738 --> 00:01:08.974
GREET ALL OF THOSE ARRIVING IN

00:01:08.975 --> 00:01:12.477
OUR STATE AND IT WILL SAY SIMPLY

00:01:12.478 --> 00:01:13.945
WELCOME HOME.

00:01:13.946 --> 00:01:15.046
&gt;&gt; Laura: ISN'T THAT NICE?

00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:18.350
IN PORTLAND ALONE, ASYLUM

00:01:18.351 --> 00:01:20.252
SEEKERS THAT ARE PRIMARILY FROM

00:01:20.253 --> 00:01:23.021
AFRICAN COUNTRIES MAKE UP 90% OF

00:01:23.022 --> 00:01:26.158
THE PEOPLE LIVING IN A CITY RUN

00:01:26.159 --> 00:01:28.660
FAMILY AND OVERFLOW SHELTERS.

00:01:28.661 --> 00:01:31.029
BACK TO TODAY.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:35.033
WHEN THE SAN ANTONIO MANAGER'S

00:01:35.034 --> 00:01:38.069
REQUEST TO PORTLAND WAS TURNED

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.704
DOWN, THE RESPONSE WAS JARRING.

00:01:39.705 --> 00:01:41.940
WE'RE WORKING WITH THEM TO

00:01:41.941 --> 00:01:43.241
IDENTIFY OTHER CITIES THROUGHOUT

00:01:43.242 --> 00:01:44.009
THE UNITED STATES WHERE THEY CAN

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:47.679
GO AND BEGIN THEIR

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.280
ASYLUM-SEEKING PROCESS.

00:01:48.281 --> 00:01:50.215
WHERE ARE THESE MIGRANTS GOING

00:01:50.216 --> 00:01:50.949
TO BE DROPPED NEXT?

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:52.551
THAT'S ANYONE'S GUEST.

00:01:52.552 --> 00:01:55.086
THE FACT THAT TWO CITIES IN TWO

00:01:55.087 --> 00:01:57.956
STATES, THOUSANDS OF MILES APART

00:01:57.957 --> 00:01:59.157
ARE BOTH AT CAPACITY?

00:01:59.158 --> 00:02:01.159
SHOULD BE ALARMING FOR ALL

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:01.526
AMERICANS.

00:02:01.527 --> 00:02:02.961
WE REACHED OUT TO OFFICIALS IN

00:02:02.962 --> 00:02:04.629
PORTLAND, MAINE AND RECEIVED THE

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.132
FOLLOWING RESPONSE FROM A CITY

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:08.833
COUNSELOR.

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:11.903
PORTLAND IS PROUD TO BE A

00:02:11.904 --> 00:02:12.671
WELCOMING CITY AND THOSE SEEKING

00:02:12.672 --> 00:02:14.105
TO BECOME AN AMERICAN.

00:02:14.106 --> 00:02:18.109
NO CITY OF 67,000 PEOPLE CAN

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.744
POSSIBLY MANAGE TO ENTIRE

00:02:19.745 --> 00:02:22.347
NATION'S IMMIGRANT SITUATION ON

00:02:22.348 --> 00:02:23.148
ITS OWN.

00:02:23.149 --> 00:02:23.448
WOW!

